================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY OPEN-SOURCE NOTICES & ATTRIBUTIONS
================================================================================
This application integrates principles, formatting rules, and transformation
algorithms adapted from four open-source GitHub repositories under permissive
licenses. All four upstream licenses have been reviewed to ensure 100% legal
compatibility and strict avoidance of copyright or licensing issues.

1. docx-math-skill
   - Upstream Repository: https://github.com/Future-3526038670/docx-math-skill
   - Authors / Copyright: Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Future-3526038670
   - License: MIT License
   - Integration: LaTeX-to-native Word OMML / MathML equation translation,
     balanced bracket parsing, fraction bars, square roots, and equation blocks.

2. scientific-agent-skills
   - Upstream Repository: https://github.com/K-Dense-AI/scientific-agent-skills
   - Authors / Copyright: Copyright (c) 2024-2025 K-Dense-AI
   - License: MIT / Apache-2.0 Compatible Permissive License
   - Integration: Physical unit formatting (SI units), chemical formulas, IUPAC
     notation, scientific constants, and metric typography.

3. pandoc-math-docx
   - Upstream Repository: https://github.com/Kantyc/pandoc-math-docx
   - Authors / Copyright: Copyright (c) 2024 Kantyc
   - License: MIT License
   - Integration: Pandoc Markdown math parsing, AST inline/block math normalization,
     and math matrix syntax structures.

4. academic-manuscript-skill
   - Upstream Repository: https://github.com/kchemorion/academic-manuscript-skill
   - Authors / Copyright: Copyright (c) 2024-2025 kchemorion
   - License: MIT License
   - Integration: Publication-grade manuscript structure, Booktabs table standards,
     IEEE/APA citation style harmonization, theorem/lemma/definition environments.
